{
  "name": "Receive WhatsApp messages and reply by keyword",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Receive WhatsApp messages\n\nEach WhatsApp message your number receives starts this workflow. A keyword picks the reply, and anything else goes to your team in the Cosend inbox.\n\n### Set it up\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-cosend** (Settings > Community nodes).\n2. Open **When a WhatsApp message arrives** and add a **Cosend API** credential with your API key (Cosend dashboard > Settings > Developer > API keys). Pick the same credential on the other Cosend nodes.\n3. Edit the keywords in **Route by keyword** and the text in each reply.\n4. Turn the workflow on. Cosend connects to it by itself, so there is no URL to copy.\n\nSend **price** or **hours** to your business number to see it answer.\n\nTested with n8n-nodes-cosend 2026.11.0 (community node; self-hosted n8n)",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a01",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Keywords\nEach rule checks the message text, in any letter case. Add a rule for each keyword you want, and give its output a name.\n\nThe last output, **Anything else**, catches every other message.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a02",
      "name": "Keywords",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Replies\nEach reply goes into the same conversation, inside WhatsApp's 24-hour window, so any text works here.\n\n**Pass to my team** puts the conversation in your Cosend inbox for a person to answer.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a03",
      "name": "Replies",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "message.received"
        ],
        "filters": {
          "messageTypes": [
            "text"
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a04",
      "name": "When a WhatsApp message arrives",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosendTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a99"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5b01",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.content.body }}",
                    "rightValue": "price",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "contains"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Prices"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5b02",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.content.body }}",
                    "rightValue": "hours",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "contains"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Opening hours"
            }
          ]
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "Anything else",
          "ignoreCase": true
        }
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a05",
      "name": "Route by keyword",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "conversation",
        "conversationId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.conversation_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "messageType": "text",
        "text": "Thanks for asking! Our prices start at 25 EUR. Reply with the service you want and we will send you the details.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a06",
      "name": "Reply with prices",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosend",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "conversation",
        "conversationId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.conversation_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "messageType": "text",
        "text": "We are open Monday to Friday, 9:00 to 18:00, and Saturday, 10:00 to 14:00. See you soon!",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a07",
      "name": "Reply with opening hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosend",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "conversation",
        "operation": "setControl",
        "conversationId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.conversation_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "control": "pending_human",
        "controlOptions": {
          "reason": "The message matched no keyword"
        }
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f5a08",
      "name": "Pass to my team",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosend",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "conversation",
        "operation": "get",
        "conversationId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.conversation_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        }
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f50c1",
      "name": "Who is answering",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosend",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f50c3",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.control }}",
              "rightValue": "bot",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f50c2",
      "name": "No person has taken over",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Your team comes first\nThe workflow answers only while no person has taken over the chat. When it passes a chat to your team, when someone picks a chat up in the Cosend inbox, or when you reply from the WhatsApp Business app, the workflow stays quiet for that chat.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "7a2e4d10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-1c2d3e4f50c4",
      "name": "Your team comes first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        200
      ]
    }
